# supabase.sql is deliberately UNTRACKED and was purged from history
# (2026-07-29). It's the whole server: covenant weights, the rare-deal
# gate, contract and NPC internals -- every tuning number that isn't
# already mirrored in the client for display. This repo is public, so
# tracking it published the economy to anyone willing to read it.
#
# As of 2026-08-21 the file is not on disk here either. It lives ONLY in
# plot-twist-world-server/supabase.sql. Keeping a second untracked copy
# in this tree was not a backup -- .gitignore hid it, so git never showed
# it drifting, and it drifted twice (1.33.3's silently unpaid stipend, and a
# 47-line regression caught on 2026-08-21). See SUPABASE.md, which IS
# tracked, for the whole story and how to apply the schema.
#
# This pattern stays so a stray copy can't be committed by accident. If
# one reappears at this path, delete it -- don't edit it.
#
# Numbers the client mirrors (rollRarity's thresholds, covenant `mods`,
# class prices) ship in the bundle regardless and are not secret.
supabase.sql
